msgstr ""
"Existing students require explicit selection and matching name and date of "
"birth. Responsible contacts are only reused with identical names and contact"
" details, and at least one contact detail. Existing records, enrolments and "
"relationships are not overwritten."

msgid ""
"Los datos han cambiado desde la revisión. Valida de nuevo antes de "
"confirmar."
msgstr "Data has changed since review. Validate again before confirming."

msgid ""
"Los vínculos nuevos se marcarán como tutor legal por tu confirmación "
"expresa."
msgstr ""
"New relationships will be marked as legal guardians following your explicit "
"confirmation."

msgid "Los vínculos nuevos serán responsables sin tutela legal verificada."
msgstr ""
"New relationships will be responsible contacts without verified legal "
"guardianship."

