"Marca dos retos para ver verde, cuatro para azul, seis para lila y ocho para"
" naranja legendario en la paleta RPG. Guarda y consulta el progreso de cada "
"aprendiz. La paleta básica mantiene sus colores simplificados."
msgstr ""
"Check two challenges for green, four for blue, six for purple and eight for "
"legendary orange in the RPG palette. Save and view each learner's progress. "
"The basic palette keeps its simplified colours."

